        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "簽名的是：哈迦利亞的兒子－省長尼希米，和西底家；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
